  "Package": "SQLDataFrame",
  "Title": "Representation of SQL tables in DataFrame metaphor",
  "Version": "1.25.0",
  "Description": "Implements bindings for SQL tables that are compatible\nwith Bioconductor S4 data structures, namely the DataFrame and\nDelayedArray. This allows SQL-derived data to be easily used\ninside other Bioconductor objects (e.g., SummarizedExperiments)\nwhile keeping everything on disk.",
